{"ticker":"ELECON","symbol":"ELECON","instrumentId":3028667,"name":"Elecon Engg. Co.","industry":"NSE-Machinery-Gen Industrial","about":"Elecon Engineering Co. Ltd. specializes in manufacturing industrial gearboxes and material handling equipment. With state-of-the-art facilities in Gujarat, the company serves a diverse range of industries including steel, cement, sugar, and power generation. Elecon's product portfolio includes helical and bevel helical gears, worm gears, conveyors, stacker reclaimers, crushers, and feeders, among others. The company's cutting-edge Bhanubhai Memorial Center of Excellence (BMCE) ensures precision manufacturing and innovation. Elecon has established a strong presence not only in India but also in international markets, making it a key player in the engineering sector with a focus on high-quality, reliable solutions.","website":"www.elecon.com","location":"Vallabh Vidyanagar, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:17:36.064Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":450.5,"changePct":1.0769575947947074,"week52High":562.65,"week52Low":354.75},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹10,109 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹2,457 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"92,004,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"162"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"31,431,315"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.44%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"4.38"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"4.2"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"—"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.02"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.65"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"24%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"41.29"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"16–54"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"14.8%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"14"},{"label":"Volume","value":"518,856"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"1,877,894"},{"label":"Master score","value":"44"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"48"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"52"},{"label":"Group ra